# circom/snarkjs build output (compiled circuit, trusted-setup files, test
# witnesses/proofs) — regeneratable from circuits/thresholdCheck.circom via
# `circom` + `snarkjs`, same reasoning as artifacts/ above. Note:
# thresholdCheck_final.zkey specifically is the actual proving key matching
# the verifier already deployed on Arc testnet — regenerating the trusted
# setup produces a different zkey that won't match that deployment, so keep
# a copy of it somewhere safe before deleting this directory.
circuits/build/